  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Natural Resource Management and Economic and Climate Resilience and in Coastal Communities of Oaxaca</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oaxaca State faces environmental challenges such as pollution and loss of forests that worsen its residents? poverty and vulnerability to natural disasters. Fondo Oaxaqueo para la Conservacin de la Naturaleza (FOCN) supports eco-tourism and sustainable agriculture enterprises to professionalize and reach new markets generate income and improve quality of life. It strengthens the ability of communities to promote responsible tourism raise awareness of natural resource management and conduct activities such as sea turtle conservation and mangrove reforestation. FOCN&apos;s activities bolster efforts to counteract environmental degradation and protect the natural resources on which communities depend.</narrative>
  </description>
